  HYPOTHESES, READ OFF THE BINDERS (`ERRATUM 455`). `exp_mem_unitaryGroup`,
  `isHermitian_neg_I_smul` and `det_exp_of_skewAdjoint` take `X ∈ skewAdjoint`;
  `det_exp_smul_of_isHermitian` takes `H.IsHermitian`; `exp_mem_specialUnitaryGroup` takes
  `X ∈ skewAdjoint` and `trace X = 0`; `expSU`, `expSU_val`, `coe_smul_traceless`, `oneParam`,
  `oneParam_zero`, `oneParam_add` and `expFull` take elements of the subtypes and nothing else. `n`
